# Subtask3: ignored files stay out of untracked status output.
> init
<<<
+ .gitliteignore ignore-patterns.txt
+ ignored.log wug.txt
+ important.log wug.txt
+ cache-a wug.txt
+ cache-ab wug.txt
+ #notes wug.txt
+ !literal wug.txt
+ plain.dat wug.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===
cache-ab
important.log
plain.dat

<<<
> add important.log
<<<
> add ignored.log
<<<
+ .gitliteignore ignore-all.txt
+ important.log notwug.txt
> add important.log
<<<
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===
important.log

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

